<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>over you</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">oftn</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">over you</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0tv6V94goKx2AL8BxZ1mSI</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.260" end="00:25.780">Ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.780" end="00:28.960">Why do I feel that you want us apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.960" end="00:30.780" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.780" end="00:32.780">When you're with me you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.780" end="00:40.170">You barely talk from the start</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.170" end="00:44.590" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.590" end="00:47.190">You don't even have to lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.190" end="00:49.910">I just need to hear it from your lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.910" end="00:52.700">On the phone you say your tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.700" end="00:57.260">But you say you love me or is it echos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.260" end="00:59.400">From my own voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.400" end="01:00.930">I hope</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.930" end="01:02.430" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.070" end="01:04.670">You'll let me know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.670" end="01:07.360">Say if we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.360" end="01:10.030">Cuz I've been begging for some closure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.030" end="01:12.700">Tell me we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.700" end="01:15.260">Cuz I've been losing my composure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.260" end="01:18.090">Say if we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.090" end="01:20.790">I know I haven't been sober</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.790" end="01:25.350">It's cuz we're over over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.350" end="01:26.850">Ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.370" end="01:34.370" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.970" end="01:54.280">Why do I feel that you want us apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.280" end="01:56.050" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.050" end="01:58.120">When you're with me you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.120" end="02:05.820">You barely talk from the start</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.820" end="02:09.940" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.940" end="02:12.490">You don't even have to lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.490" end="02:15.100">I just need to hear it from your lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.100" end="02:17.740">On the phone you say your tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.740" end="02:22.490">But you say you love me or is it echos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.490" end="02:24.770">From my own voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.770" end="02:26.310">I hope</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.310" end="02:27.810" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.230" end="02:29.860">You'll let me know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.860" end="02:32.740">Say if we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.740" end="02:35.260">Cuz I've been begging for some closure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.260" end="02:38.040">Tell me we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.040" end="02:40.620">Cuz I've been losing my composure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.620" end="02:43.560">Say if we're over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.560" end="02:46.050">I know I haven't been sober</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.050" end="02:50.050">It's cuz we're over over over</p></div></body></tt>